{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Playgrounds",
    "steam_appid": 3208410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208410/extras/7b65a9d0c71dd3842cdede9b335af92d.avif?t=1753992610\" width=616 height=264 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your own games. In your own way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playgrounds</strong> is a creative sandbox where <i>you</i> call the shots. Build fully functional 2D games with zero coding knowledge, and share them online with the world. Whether you're designing a wild physics experiment, a challenging platformer, or a relaxing pixel art vibe \u2014 this is your space to play, express, and connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design the game you want to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Playgrounds\u2019 intuitive drag-and-drop tools, you can craft your own levels, tweak behaviors, fine-tune physics, and trigger events that bring your world to life. Gravity? Optional. Explosions? Encouraged. Rules? Yours to rewrite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make it look like <i>you</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Playgrounds\u2019 built-in art editor to design your own characters, tiles, objects, and animations \u2014 or explore a massive library of community-made assets. Every element in your game can be customized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animate it, color it, share it \u2014 <strong>your style belongs on center stage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re not alone in the Playground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your games with the community, discover creations from players around the world, leave comments, show love with likes, and make new friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to build or to be inspired \u2014 this is your creative tribe.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208410/extras/7b65a9d0c71dd3842cdede9b335af92d.avif?t=1753992610\" width=616 height=264 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your own games. In your own way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playgrounds</strong> is a creative sandbox where <i>you</i> call the shots. Build fully functional 2D games with zero coding knowledge, and share them online with the world. Whether you're designing a wild physics experiment, a challenging platformer, or a relaxing pixel art vibe \u2014 this is your space to play, express, and connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design the game you want to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Playgrounds\u2019 intuitive drag-and-drop tools, you can craft your own levels, tweak behaviors, fine-tune physics, and trigger events that bring your world to life. Gravity? Optional. Explosions? Encouraged. Rules? Yours to rewrite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make it look like <i>you</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Playgrounds\u2019 built-in art editor to design your own characters, tiles, objects, and animations \u2014 or explore a massive library of community-made assets. Every element in your game can be customized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animate it, color it, share it \u2014 <strong>your style belongs on center stage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re not alone in the Playground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your games with the community, discover creations from players around the world, leave comments, show love with likes, and make new friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to build or to be inspired \u2014 this is your creative tribe.</p>",
